ratic sweep in the US midterm elections sent oil plunging on speculation the conflict with Iran will end sooner.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-04T22:15:04.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Korea to Introduce Cornerstone Lockups to Curb Post-IPO Selloffs", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-05/korea-to-introduce-cornerstone-lockups-to-curb-post-ipo-selloffs", "excerpt": "South Korea’s top financial regulator will introduce a system for cornerstone investors in initial public offerings to curb sharp price drops after listings.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:48:32.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "韩国最高金融监管机构将引入IPO基石投资者锁定期制度，以抑制新股上市后股价大幅下跌，目标是限制基石投资者在上市后立即抛售。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Philippine October Inflation Accelerates 7.8%, Close to Four-Year High", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-05/philippine-october-inflation-accelerates-7-8-close-to-four-year-high", "excerpt": "Philippine inflation accelerated to its fastest pace in almost four years in October as the prolonged Middle East conflict drove up the cost of fuel, electricity and transport in a nation heavily reliant on the region for its energy supplies.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:05:46.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "菲律宾10月通胀率升至7.8%，接近四年高位。中东冲突持续推高燃油、电力和交通成本，而该国能源供应高度依赖该地区。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "China Tech Frenzy Turns Into Year of Dismay for Retail Traders", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-05/china-tech-frenzy-turns-into-year-of-dismay-for-retail-traders", "excerpt": "What started out as a year of hope for China’s stock market has turned into one of disillusion for its 250 million retail investors.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T00:00:00.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "中国股市年初的乐观情绪转为失望，2.5亿散户投资者经历失意的一年，科技板块炒作行情未能带来预期回报。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Gold Holds Above $4,000 as Dollar, Yields Fall on Midterm Result", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-04/gold-holds-above-4-000-as-dollar-yields-fall-on-midterm-result", "excerpt": "Gold held the biggest surge since August after a Democratic sweep of Congress in US midterm elections sent the dollar and Treasury yields lower, boosting its appeal.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-04T23:58:33.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "美国中期选举中民主党大胜后，美元与美债收益率走低，提振黄金吸引力。金价维持在每盎司4000美元上方，并录得8月以来最大涨幅。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Australian Chain David Jones Collapses After Almost 200 Years", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-04/australian-chain-david-jones-collapses-after-almost-200-years", "excerpt": "Australia’s oldest department store David Jones collapsed on Thursday, finally succumbing after almost 200 years to a digital era that sent shoppers to cheaper and nimbler online rivals.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-04T23:44:05.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "澳大利亚最老牌百货公司David Jones于周四倒闭，在近200年历史后最终未能抵御数字时代冲击，消费者转向更便宜、更灵活的线上竞争对手。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Asian Markets React as Trump Cools Iran Fears", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-04/asian-markets-react-as-trump-cools-iran-fears-video", "excerpt": "President Trump stated he has no immediate plans for further strikes on Iran, easing geopolitical risk across the region. The remarks triggered a sharp decline in crude oil and fueled a broad rally across Asian equities. (Source: Bloomberg)", "publishedAt": "2026-11-04T23:31:57.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "美国总统特朗普表示暂无进一步打击伊朗的计划，地区地缘政治风险缓和，国际原油价格大幅下跌，亚洲股市普遍上涨。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "US Tweaks Debt-Sale Guidance, Signals Auction Changes Ahead", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-04/us-revamps-debt-sales-guidance-opening-path-to-auction-changes", "excerpt": "The US Treasury Department revamped the guidance on sales of notes and bonds it has used since early 2024, in a move that dealers said opens the door to ​larger sales of short-dated debt and potentially cuts to longer-dated auctions.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-04T13:34:13.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Malaysia Set to Hold Rates on Strong Growth, Signal Hike in 2027", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-04/malaysia-set-to-hold-rates-on-strong-growth-signal-hike-in-2027", "excerpt": "Malaysia’s central bank is expected to keep interest rates unchanged at its final policy meeting of the year on Thursday while signaling scope for a hike early in 2027 as economic growth remains strong.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-04T23:00:00.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "马来西亚央行预计在周四今年最后一次政策会议上维持利率不变，同时释放2027年初可能加息的信号，因经济增长依然强劲。"}], "overview": "当日最大变量来自美国中期选举：民主党横扫参众两院，美元与美债收益率回落、金价站稳4000美元上方，市场反应总体平静，但特朗普的伊朗、关税与对华政策进入受制约阶段。科技领域，OpenAI宣布收购Pierre以强化Codex代码审查能力，并披露自动发现并修补Linux内核948个提权漏洞的智能体流水线；德州AI数据中心扩张或因政治版图变化承压。财经方面，澳大利亚百年百货David Jones破产托管，CVS拟分拆约9000家药店，菲律宾通胀升至7.8%，中国AI概念股回撤令散户失望。时政上，德国政客艾万格死于柏林酒店、俄乌「双击」空袭致至少40人死亡，同样值得关注。", "market": {"market_overview": "美股方面技术面分化：SPY现价766.81贴近52周高（-1.89%）但RSI14仅40.2、低于SMA20 768.09，QQQ单日+1.59%却5日-4.06%、RSI14 34.6偏弱，大型科技内MSFT单日+9.6%呈多头排列，而GOOGL RSI14 22.2超卖并现死叉、NVDA 5日-8.17%，指数层面为震荡中性。加密方面恐慌贪婪指数50处中性，总市值2.71T（24h +1.11%）、BTC主导率59.6%、ETH占10.9%；BTC现价80523.41站上SMA200 73181.6、RSI14 51，ETH单日+6.49%并现MACD金叉，SOL RSI14 37.7偏弱，整体处修复但未脱离中性。中概股普遍反弹：JD 5日+8.45%、BABA +5.04%、PDD与0700.HK均现MACD金叉，但BABA、0700.HK仍空头排列、距52周高逾39%。商品外汇与宏观偏弱：WTI 5日-14.05%并现MACD死叉、黄金空头排列、USDCNY=X逼近52周低且空头排列；VIX单日-20.26%至16.61，10Y收益率4.89%低于SMA20 5.07，DXY 101.36虽多头排列但MACD柱转负。整体呈美股内部分化、加密中性修复、中概超跌反弹、商品与宏观动能偏弱的格局。", "watchlist": [{"symbol": "GOOGL", "display_name": "Alphabet (GOOGL)